{"data":[{"id":535782,"date_start":"2022-07-20","date_end":"2022-07-22","date_next":"2022-07-21","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[3],"translations":{"fr":["Musique Contemporaine"],"nl":["Hedendaagse Muziek"],"en":["Contemporary music"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"The Call Back Brussels","shortdescr":"Venez nous rejoindre pour 3 soir\u00e9es o\u00f9 vous d\u00e9couvrirez l'art chr\u00e9tien sous ses multiples formes \u00e0 travers les chants gospel, la peinture, la danse, etc.","longdescr":"Venez nous rejoindre pour 3 soir\u00e9es o\u00f9 vous d\u00e9couvrirez l'art chr\u00e9tien sous ses multiples formes \u00e0 travers les chants gospel, la peinture, la danse, etc.\r\n\r\nUn message d'espoir et d'encouragement sur la foi chr\u00e9tienne sera \u00e9galement partag\u00e9 !\r\nC'est l'endroit id\u00e9al pour obtenir des r\u00e9ponses aux questions existentielles que vous vous posez peut-\u00eatre.\r\n\r\nAlors \u00e0 vos agendas les 20, 21 et 22 juillet \u00e0 19h !\r\nCet \u00e9v\u00e9nement est ouvert \u00e0 tous, quelles que soient vos convictions religieuses et\u2026 c'est 100% gratuit !\r\n\r\nObtenez votre billet gratuit sur EventBrite : https:\/\/www.eventbrite.com\/e\/awakening-europe-call-back-city-brussels-tickets-321462371607\r\n\r\nNous esp\u00e9rons vous rencontrer nombreux  !\r\n\r\nOrganis\u00e9 par Awakening Europe et les \u00e9glises belges locales.","performers":"Ben Fitzgerald (orateur); Samuel Grondin (orateur); Matt McCluskey (orateur); Ignite Church Music (groupe de musique); Maison d'impact (groupe de musique); The Shift (groupe de musique); Voix d'eau vive (groupe de musique); Feel God (groupe de musique); Red Rocks Brussels (groupe de musique); Chosen (artiste); Emjy (artiste).","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1KrQUe2Ni","email":"ignitechurch.evangelism@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/535782.html"},"nl":{"name":"The Call Back Brussels","shortdescr":"Kom ons vervoegen op 3 avonden waar je christelijke kunst in haar vele vormen zult ontdekken door middel van gospelliederen, schilderen, dans, enz.","longdescr":"Kom ons vervoegen op 3 avonden waar je christelijke kunst in haar vele vormen zult ontdekken door middel van gospelliederen, schilderen, dans, enz.\r\n\r\nEr zal ook een boodschap van hoop en bemoediging over het christelijk geloof worden gedeeld!\r\nHet is de perfecte plek om antwoord te krijgen op al uw bestaande vragen.\r\n\r\nDus zet 20, 21 en 22 juli om 19:00 uur in jouw agenda!\r\nDit evenement staat open voor iedereen, ongeacht je religieuze overtuigingen en... het is 100% gratis!\r\n\r\nHaal je gratis ticket op EventBrite: https:\/\/www.eventbrite.com\/e\/awakening-europe-call-back-city-brussels-tickets-321462371607\r\n\r\nWe hopen velen van jullie te ontmoeten!\r\n\r\nGeorganiseerd door Awakening Europe en lokale Belgische kerken.","performers":"Ben Fitzgerald (spreker); Samuel Grondin (spreker); Matt McCluskey (spreker); Ignite Church Music (band); Maison d'impact (band); The Shift (band); Voix d'eau vive (band); Feel God (band); Red Rocks Brussels (band); Chosen (artiest); Emjy (artiest).","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/ignitechurchbrussels\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/535782.html"},"en":{"name":"The Call Back Brussels","shortdescr":"Come join us for 3 evenings where you will discover Christian art in its many forms through gospel songs, painting, dance, etc.","longdescr":"Come join us for 3 evenings where you will discover Christian art in its many forms through gospel songs, painting, dance, etc.\r\n\r\nA message of hope and encouragement on the Christian faith will also be shared!\r\nIt's the perfect place to get answers to any existential questions you may have.\r\n\r\nSo mark your calendars on July 20, 21 and 22 at 7 p.m.!\r\nThis event is open to everyone, whatever your religious beliefs are and\u2026 it's 100% free!\r\n\r\nGet your free ticket on EventBrite: https:\/\/www.eventbrite.com\/e\/awakening-europe-call-back-city-brussels-tickets-321462371607\r\n\r\nWe hope to meet many of you!\r\n\r\nOrganized by Awakening Europe and local Belgian churches.","performers":"Ben Fitzgerald (orateur); Samuel Grondin (orateur); Matt McCluskey (orateur); Ignite Church Music (groupe de musique); Maison d'impact (groupe de musique); The Shift (groupe de musique); Voix d'eau vive (groupe de musique); Feel God (groupe de musique); Red Rocks Brussels (groupe de musique); Chosen (artiste); Emjy (artiste).","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/535782.html"},"de":{"name":"The Call Back Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/535782.html"},"it":{"name":"The Call Back Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/535782.html"},"sp":{"name":"The Call Back Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/535782.html"},"pt":{"name":"The Call Back Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/535782.html"},"cn":{"name":"The Call Back Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/535782.html"}},"place":{"id":4614,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"La Madeleine","address_street_name":"Rue Duquesnoy","address_street_number":"14","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.la-madeleine.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Duquesnoy, 14","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"La fa\u00e7ade de La Madeleine est le seul \u00e9l\u00e9ment conserv\u00e9 du vaste march\u00e9 couvert construit d\u00e8s 1847 sur les plans de l\u2019Architecte J-P Cluysenaar et inaugur\u00e9 en 1848. Il constituait le premier march\u00e9 couvert de Bruxelles, \u00e0 l\u2019exception du petit march\u00e9 aux fleurs, con\u00e7u juste avant par le m\u00eame architecte dans les Galeries Saint-Hubert. C\u2019\u00e9tait aussi \u00e0 Bruxelles, l\u2019une des premi\u00e8res constructions importantes en m\u00e9tal.\r\nLe march\u00e9 de la Madeleine fut d\u00e9truit en 1957 et c\u00e9da la place \u00e0 la salle des f\u00eates de la Ville de Bruxelles. La fa\u00e7ade en pierres de taille, dont l\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9vation est inspir\u00e9e par la Loggia dei Lanzi de la Piazza della Signoria \u00e0 Florence, a \u00e9t\u00e9 conserv\u00e9e en devanture d\u2019un nouveau b\u00e2timent.\r\nDurant une cinquantaine d\u2019ann\u00e9es, la salle accueillit une multitude d\u2019\u00e9v\u00e8nements festifs et culturels en tout genre. La salle est \u00e9galement connue du public pour ses soir\u00e9es, telles que le Bal des Fonctionnaires qu\u2019elle a longtemps abrit\u00e9. \r\nApr\u00e8s une exploitation de plusieurs ann\u00e9es par le Casino de Bruxelles, la Ville de Bruxelles a officiellement confi\u00e9 la gestion de la Salle de la Madeleine \u00e0 Brussels Expo.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"La Madeleine","address_street_name":"Duquesnoystraat","address_street_number":"14","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.la-madeleine.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Duquesnoystraat, 14","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De gevel van La Madeleine is het enige element dat overblijft van de grote overdekte markt die in 1847 werd opgetrokken naar een ontwerp van architect J-P Cluysenaar en officieel in gebruik genomen in 1848. Het was de enige overdekte markt in Brussel, naast de kleine bloemenmarkt in de Sint-Hubertusgalerij die kort voordien door dezelfde architect was ontworpen. De markt was ook \u00e9\u00e9n van de eerste grote constructies in metaal.\r\nDe markt van La Madeleine werd in 1957 afgebroken om plaats te maken voor de feestzaal van de Stad Brussel. De hardstenen gevel, ge\u00efnspireerd op de Loggia dei Lanzi de la Piazza della Signoria in Firenze, bleef bewaard als voorgevel voor een nieuw gebouw.\r\nGedurende ongeveer vijftig jaar vonden er in de zaal talrijke feestelijke en culturele evenementen van uiteenlopende aard plaats. Ze was bij het grote publiek ook bekend voor de feesten die er regelmatig plaatsvonden, zoals het Bal van de Ambtenaren dat er jarenlang een onderkomen vond.\r\nNa meerdere jaren exploitatie door het Casino van Brussel heeft de Stad Brussel het beheer van La Madeleine nu officieel toegewezen aan Brussels Expo.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"La Madeleine","address_street_name":"Rue Duquesnoy","address_street_number":"14","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.la-madeleine.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Duquesnoy, 14","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The facade of La Madeleine is the only surviving part of the large covered market built in 1847 on the plans of the architect J-P Cluysenaar and inaugurated in 1848. It was the first covered market in Brussels, with the exception of the small flower market designed a short time previously by the same architect in the Galeries Saint-Hubert. It was also one of Brussels\u2019 first large metal constructions.\r\nThe Madeleine market was destroyed in 1957 and gave way to the festival hall of the City of Brussels. The cut stone fa\u00e7ade, whose elevation is inspired by the Loggia dei Lanzi in the Piazza della Signoria in Florence, was kept as the front of a new building.\r\nFor fifty years, the hall welcomed a host of festive and cultural events of all kinds. The venue is also known to the public for its receptions. It is notably where, for a long time, the city\u2019s officials would gather for their annual dance, the Bal des Fonctionnaires.\r\nAfter being operated for several years by the Casino of Brussels, the City of Brussels has officially entrusted the management of the Salle de la Madeleine to Brussels Expo.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"La Madeleine","address_street_name":"Rue Duquesnoy","address_street_number":"14","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.la-madeleine.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Duquesnoy, 14","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"La Madeleine","address_street_