 09:30 tot 17:00","zaterdag en zondag: van 10:00 tot 17:00"],"en":["monday: closed","tuesday, wednesday, thursday and friday: from 09:30 to 17:00","saturday and sunday: from 10:00 to 17:00"]},"date_start":"2022-07-01","date_end":"2022-08-31","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Enfants"},"nl":{"name":"Kinderen"},"en":{"name":"Children"}},"value":0},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Seniors"},"nl":{"name":"Senioren"},"en":{"name":"Seniors"}},"value":13},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":15},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"museumpassmus\u00e9es"},"nl":{"name":"museumpassmus\u00e9es"},"en":{"name":"museumpassmus\u00e9es"}},"value":0}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[11,3,4],"translations":{"fr":["Famille","Enfants 3-6 ans","Enfants 6-9 ans"],"nl":["Familie","Kinderen 3-6 j.","Kinderen 6-9 j."],"en":["Family","Children 3-6 yr.","Children 6-9 yr."]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":{"list":[252,255,256,257,259,261,263,265],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible aux personnes ayant des difficult\u00e9s de compr\u00e9hension","Accessible","Am\u00e9nagements pour les personnes aveugles et malvoyantes","Am\u00e9nagements pour personnes sourdes et malentendantes","Chien d'assistance","Parking accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Toegankelijk","Voorzieningen voor blinde en slechtziende personen","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Facilities for blind and partially-sighted persons","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-07-21T01:08:59+02:00","published_at":"2022-05-17T12:57:06+02:00","backoffice_id":253839,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.31833136784577},{"id":536068,"date_start":"2022-07-01","date_end":"2022-07-31","date_next":"2022-07-21","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition"}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["en","fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Imagine me (for what I could be)","shortdescr":"Au cours du mois de juillet 2022, une installation cr\u00e9\u00e9e par des artistes et leurs homologues europ\u00e9ens animera les environs de la Commission europ\u00e9enne. Tandis que les artistes de la R\u00e9publique tch\u00e8que s\u2019inspireront du drapeau tch\u00e8que et ce que ce symbole repr\u00e9sente pour eux aujourd'hui, des artistes d'autres pays europ\u00e9ens \u00ab \u00e9criront \u00bb \u00e0 travers leurs \u0153uvres un message \u00e0 la capitale europ\u00e9enne.","longdescr":"Des drapeaux de grande format con\u00e7us sp\u00e9cialement pour occasion flotteront au-dessus des rues Archim\u00e8de, Franklin et Stevin du 1er au 31 juillet, \u00e0 proximit\u00e9 du si\u00e8ge de la Commission europ\u00e9enne (Berlaymont). Les motifs des drapeaux cr\u00e9\u00e9s par les artistes tch\u00e8ques seront bas\u00e9s sur le drapeau tch\u00e8que, qu'il s'agisse de ses couleurs, de sa composition ou de sa valeur culturelle. Artiste visuelle Lucie Jindr\u00e1k Sk\u0159iv\u00e1nkov\u00e1, le collectif engag\u00e9 Comunite Fresca, graphiste et illustratrice Vendula Chal\u00e1nkov\u00e1 et un de graphistes le plus reconnus tch\u00e8que Ale\u0161 Najbrt font partie des cr\u00e9ateursinvit\u00e9s. \r\n\r\nUn certain nombre d'artistes d\u2019autres pays - d'Espagne, d'Allemagne, de Su\u00e8de, de Slovaquie, d'Italie, de Slov\u00e9nie, de Lettonie, de Pologne et d'Ukraine, participeront \u00e9galement au projet. Ayant cependant un objectif l\u00e9g\u00e8rement diff\u00e9rent, ils cr\u00e9ent des messages \u00e0 destination de la capitale europ\u00e9enne qui refl\u00e8tent des questions et des \u00e9motions sur la situation actuelle en UE.\r\n\r\nLE PROJET EST COORGANIS\u00c9 PAR ASSOCIATION DES COMMER\u00c7ANTS CARREFOUR JEAN MONNET AVEC L\u2019AIMABLE SOUTIEN DE LA VILLE DE BRUXELLES.\r\n\r\nLE CURATRICE DE CE PROJET EST TEREZA PORYBN\u00c1, PRODUCTRICE CULTURELLE, CURATRICE ET ANCIENNE DIRECTRICE DU CENTRE TCH\u00c8QUE \u00c0 LONDRES.\r\n\r\nUne liste compl\u00e8te des artistes participants, ainsi que des informations sur les diff\u00e9rentes \u0153uvres seront publi\u00e9s dans les jours prochains.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/en\/program\/zacatek-ceskeho-predsednictvi-doprovodi-instalace-imagine-me?locale=en","email":"ccbrussels@czech.cz","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/536068.html"},"nl":{"name":"Imagine me (for what I could be)","shortdescr":"Openbaar kunstproject ter ere van het Tsjechische voorzitterschap van de Raad van de EU in 2022. Drie\u00ebntwintig kunstenaars uit elf landen kwamen samen om de hedendaagse esthetiek en betekenissen van de Tsjechische en Europese vlaggen opnieuw te bedenken en hun eigen interpretaties te cre\u00ebren. Het resultaat is van 1 tot 31 juli te zien in de Archim\u00e8destraat, de Franklinstraat en de Stevinstraat.","longdescr":"De kunstwerken die deel uitmaken van de installatie Imagine Me transformeren op fantasierijke wijze gevestigde vormen in nieuwe, door gebruikt te maken van verschillende technieken, van tekenen tot typografie tot 3D-weergave. Sommige zijn speels en ondeugend en wekken levendigheid en een glimlach op, terwijl andere meningen, zorgen en verlangens uitdrukken met betrekking tot de tijd waarin wij leven. Imagine Me communiceert de noodzaak om te zorgen voor elkaar, onze planeet te beschermen, in vrede te leven, en ruimte te houden voor magie en kunst in onszelf en om ons heen. Samen vormen de werken een collectief geheel van beelden en woorden die boven de straten van Brussel zweven en de aandacht vestigen op mogelijkheden en toekomsten.\r\n\r\nHET PROJECT WORDT GECUREERD DOOR TEREZA PORYBN\u00c1\r\n\r\nDIT EVENEMENT VINDT PLAATS ONDER AUSPICI\u00cbN VAN MEVR. V\u011aRA JOUROV\u00c1, LID VAN DE EUROPESE COMMISSIE, EN DE VOORZITTER VAN DE SENAAT VAN HET PARLEMENT VAN DE TSJECHISCHE REPUBLIEK, DE HEER MILO\u0160 VYSTR\u010cIL.\r\n\r\nGEORGANISEERD MET DE STEUN VAN HET BOHEMIAN HERITAGE FUND.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/fr\/programme\/zacatek-ceskeho-predsednictvi-doprovodi-instalace-imagine-me?locale=fr","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/536068.html"},"en":{"name":"Imagine me (for what I could be)","shortdescr":"In July 2022, the streets surrounding the European Commission will be enlivened by an installation created by Czech artists and their European counterparts. While artists from the Czech Republic will depict the Czech flag and what this symbol means to them today, artists from other European countries will \u201cwrite\u201d a message to Brussels during the Czech EU Presidency through their works.","longdescr":"Unique large-scale flags will fly above Brussels\u2019 Rue Archim\u00e8de, Rue Franklin and Rue Stevin right in the heart of the EU quarter from 1 to 31 July. The motifs of the banners created by Czech artists will be based on the Czech flag \u2013\u2060 be it its colours, composition or cultural value. Lucie Jindr\u00e1k Sk\u0159iv\u00e1nkov\u00e1, the Comunite Fresca collective, Vendula Chal\u00e1nkov\u00e1 and Ale\u0161 Najbrt are among the already confirmed Czech creators, who will have the opportunity to share their feelings towards one of the main symbols of the Czech Republic with the people of Brussels through the flags. At the same time, the artists and their works will bring the imagination and energy of transforming established shapes into new ones to the streets of the Schuman quarter.\r\n\r\nA number of artists from other countries will also take part in the project, specifically ones from Spain, Germany, Italy, Sweden, Slovakia, Slovenia, Latvia, Poland and Ukraine. They, however, have a slightly different assignment, namely, to create messages for Brusselsthat reflect the artists\u2019 questions and emotions about the current situation in Europe.\r\n\r\nTHE PROJECT IS CO-ORGANISED BY ASSOCIATION DES COMMER\u00c7ANTS CARREFOUR JEAN MONNET WITH KIND SUPPORT OF THE CITY OF BRUSSELS.\r\n\r\nTHE PROJECT IS CURATED BY TEREZA PORYBN\u00c1, A CULTURAL PRODUCER, CURATOR AND FORMER DIRECTOR OF CZECH CENTRE LONDON.\r\n\r\nFull list of the artists participating will be published soon, along with more information about the individual works.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/nl\/het-programma\/zacatek-ceskeho-predsednictvi-doprovodi-instalace-imagine-me?locale=nl","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/536068.html"},"de":{"name":"Imagine Me (...for What I Could Be)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/536068.html"},"it":{"name":"Imagine Me (...for What I Could Be)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/536068.html"},"sp":{"name":"Imagine Me (...for What I Could Be)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/536068.html"},"pt":{"name":"Imagine Me (...for What I Could Be)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/536068.html"},"cn":{"name":"Imagine Me (...for What I Could Be)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/536068.html"}},"place":{"id":274716,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_street_name":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Au pied du Berlaymont, si\u00e8ge de la Commission europ\u00e9enne, le carrefour Jean Monnet sert de point de d\u00e9part \u00e0 l\u2019exploration du quartier europ\u00e9en dans son volet un peu moins business. Restaurants, bars et lieux de rassemblements de la faune europ\u00e9ennes se d\u00e9ploient dans les rues donnant sur le carrefour. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Jean Monnetkruispunt","address_street_name":"Jean Monnetkruispunt","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Jean Monnetkruispunt","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Aan de voet van het Berlaymontgebouw, waar de Europese Commissie huist, ligt het Jean Monnetkruispunt. Hier kan je perfect starten om de minder zakelijke kant van de Europese wijk te verkennen. Heel wat restaurants, bars en andere ontmoetingsplekken liggen in de straten die uitgeven op dit plein. Veel plezier met je trip door Europa! ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_street_name":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"At the foot of the European Commission's headquarters in Berlaymont building, carrefour Jean Monnet serves as a starting point for exploring the less business-like side of the European Quarter. Restaurants, bars and some of the favourite meeting places of expatriates and European officials are dotted around the streets overlooking the crossroads. Schuman roundabout is just a few steps away. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_street_name":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_street_name":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_street_name":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_street_name":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_street_name":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Carrefour Jean Monnet","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[9],"translations":{"fr":["Quartier europ\u00e9en"],"nl":["Europese wijk"],"en":["European Quarter"]}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"fr":["Est"],"nl":["Oost"],"en":["East"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":34716,"location":{"lat":50.84417228,"lon":4.38388901},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-07-21T01:35:50+02:00","published_at":"2019-10-22T09:30:31+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":230104,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Centre Tch\u00e8que","address_street_name":"Avenue Adolphe Buyl","address_street_number":"150 152","address_street_box":null,"email":"ccbrussels@czech.cz","website":"https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/fr\/?locale=fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 641 89 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Adolphe Buyl, 150 152","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"En Belgique, le Centre tch\u00e8que a \u00e9t\u00e9 fond\u00e9 en 1997. Depuis, il propose de nombreux \u00e9v\u00e9nements culturels organis\u00e9s avec des partenaires belges, tch\u00e8ques et \u00e9trangers. Nous sommes, entre autres, actifs dans les domaines des arts plastiques, du film, de la musique, du th\u00e9\u00e2tre, des sciences, de l\u2019architecture et du design. Nous comptons, dans nos partenaires des institutions europ\u00e9ennes aussi bien que des centres culturels, communes, th\u00e9\u00e2tres, festivals et les universit\u00e9s bruxellois(es). Nous participons donc de mani\u00e8re r\u00e9currente \u00e0 la bouillonnante vie culturelle belge.\r\n\r\nLe Centre tch\u00e8que \u00e0 Bruxelles est situ\u00e9, comme son nom l\u2019indique, \u00e0 Bruxelles. Toutefois, nous sommes actifs dans le reste de la Belgique que ce soit en Wallonie ou en Flandre et par extension, dans le Grand-Duch\u00e9 du Luxembourg.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Tsjechisch Centrum","address_street_name":"Adolphe Buyllaan","address_street_number":"150 152","address_street_box":null,"email":"ccbrussels@czech.cz","website":"https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/nl\/?locale=nl","phone_contact":"+32 2 641 89 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Adolphe Buyllaan, 150 152","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"De Tsjechische centra, een gesubsidieerde organisatie van het Ministerie van Buitenlandse Zaken van Tsjechi\u00eb, zijn het kerninstrument van de publieksdiplomatie van de buitenlandpolitiek van Tsjechi\u00eb en versterken de goede naam van Tsjechi\u00eb in de wereld. Als culturele instelling zijn ze lid van het netwerk van buitenlandse, Europese culturele instellingen \u2013 EUNIC. Ze presenteren ons land binnen een breed scala van culturele en sociale gebieden: van kunst tot creatieve industrie tot promotie van successen van de Tsjechische wetenschap en innovaties. Ze houden zich bezig met onderwijs van het Tsjechisch in het buitenland. Ze sluiten zich aan bij internationale projecten en dienen als platform voor ontwikkeling van de internationale culturele dialoog. Momenteel zijn er in het buitenland op drie continenten in totaal 26 locaties actief \u2013 naast de Tsjechische centra beheren ze eveneens het Tsjechische huis in Moskou, Jeruzalem en Bratislava.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Centre Tch\u00e8que","address_street_name":"Avenue Adolphe Buyllaan","address_street_number":"150 152","address_street_box":null,"email":"ccbrussels@czech.cz","website":"https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/en\/?locale=en","phone_contact":"+32 2 641 89 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Adolphe Buyllaan, 150 152","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"In Belgium, the Czech Centre was founded in 1997. Since then, it has offered numerous cultural events organised with Belgian, Czech and foreign partners. We are active in the fields of visual arts, film, music, theatre, science, architecture and design. Our partners include European institutions as well as cultural centres, municipalities, theatres, festivals, and universities in Brussels. We are therefore a regular participant in the vibrant Belgian cultural life.\r\n\r\nThe Czech Centre Brussels is located, as its name suggests, in Brussels. However, we are active in the rest of Belgium, whether in Wallonia or Flanders and, by extension, in the Grand Duchy of Luxembourg.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Centre Tch\u00e8que","address_street_name":"Avenue Adolphe Buyl","address_street_number":"150 152","address_street_box":null,"email":"ccbrussels@czech.cz","website":"https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/fr\/?locale=fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 641 89 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Adolphe Buyl, 150 152","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Centre Tch\u00e8que","address_street_name":"Avenue Adolphe Buyl","address_street_number":"150 152","address_street_box":null,"email":"ccbrussels@czech.cz","website":"https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/fr\/?locale=fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 641 89 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Adolphe Buyl, 150 152","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Centre Tch\u00e8que","address_street_name":"Avenue Adolphe Buyl","address_street_number":"150 152","address_street_box":null,"email":"ccbrussels@czech.cz","website":"https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/fr\/?locale=fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 641 89 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Adolphe Buyl, 150 152","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Centre Tch\u00e8que","address_street_name":"Avenue Adolphe Buyl","address_street_number":"150 152","address_street_box":null,"email":"ccbrussels@czech.cz","website":"https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/fr\/?locale=fr","phone_contact":"+32 2 641 89 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_l