e0 l'affaire. Le secteur brassicole reprend du poil de la b\u00eate depuis quelques ann\u00e9es, et certaines se font fer de lance de l'innovation en canettes. Parmi celles-ci: l'Ermitage. Venez d\u00e9couvrir leur histoire et ce qui fait de cette brasserie un lieu unique!\r\nEn plus: une d\u00e9gustation comment\u00e9e pour compl\u00e9ter le tableau!","performers":"Cedric Jamar (guide)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.agalmalt.com","email":"hello@agalmalt.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 486 70 57 43","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/517604.html"},"nl":{"name":"Visites de la Brasserie de l'Ermitage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/517604.html"},"en":{"name":"Ermitage Nanobrewery Tours","shortdescr":"Come to visit the Hermit and one of the most innovative Brussels breweries!","longdescr":"Beer is part of our cultural legacy in Belgium, and Brussels takes it own share of it. The brewing industry is having its renewal for quite a while now, and some of them are part of the cutting edge of it. A blatant example of the latest taste innovation in beer: Ermitage. Come and discover the story behind the legend, and find out what makes this place so unique! And after that: we'll share a flight together!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/517604.html"},"de":{"name":"Visites de la Brasserie de l'Ermitage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/517604.html"},"it":{"name":"Visites de la Brasserie de l'Ermitage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_