nd panel de tours, allant de la d\u00e9gustation de chocolat \u00e0 celle de la bi\u00e8re, en passant par la d\u00e9couverte de l\u2019art culinaire belge, tout cela combin\u00e9 avec une d\u00e9couverte personnalis\u00e9e de la ville.\r\n\r\nL\u2019entreprise propose \u00e9galement des voyages sur mesure, personnalisables selon vos envies, Gand, Bruges ou le Luxembourg.\r\n\r\nLangues: fran\u00e7ais, n\u00e9erlandais, anglais.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Global Enterprises","address_street_name":"Grand Place","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@globalenterprises.be","website":"http:\/\/globalenterprises.be","phone_contact":"+32 479 31 90 03","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grand Place, 21","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Global Enterprises","address_street_name":"Grand Place","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@globalenterprises.be","website":"http:\/\/globalenterprises.be","phone_contact":"+32 479 31 90 03","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Grand Place, 21","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Global Enterprises Tours is a professional trade company created with the primary purpose of promoting Brussels\u2019s legacy within the tour operator industry. \r\n\r\nThe company specialises in providing competitive and superior quality tours to independent travellers, whether private or in a custom group, through a diverse brochure of tour programs and packages, including chocolate, beer and cuisine and city discovery.\r\n\r\nThe company is also an adept of the tailor-made travel, customizable to suit the needs and preferences of the clients and therefore organizing tours as well in Bruges, Gent or Luxembourg.