"translations":{"fr":["lundi, mardi, jeudi, vendredi, samedi et dimanche: ferm\u00e9","mercredi: de 18:00 \u00e0 21:00"],"nl":["maandag, dinsdag, donderdag, vrijdag, zaterdag en zondag: gesloten","woensdag: van 18:00 tot 21:00"],"en":["monday, tuesday, thursday, friday, saturday and sunday: closed","wednesday: from 18:00 to 21:00"]},"date_start":"2022-06-25","date_end":"2022-09-18","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"date_exceptions":[{"day":"2022-06-25","start":"11:00:00","end":null},{"day":"2022-06-26","start":"10:30:00","end":null},{"day":"2022-07-02","start":"12:00:00","end":null},{"day":"2022-08-26","start":"17:00:00","end":null},{"day":"2022-09-03","start":"18:30:00","end":"20:30:00"},{"day":"2022-09-10","start":"18:00:00","end":"21:00:00"},{"day":"2022-09-11","start":"17:00:00","end":null},{"day":"2022-09-15","start":"19:00:00","end":"22:00:00"},{"day":"2022-09-16","start":"19:00:00","end":"22:00:00"},{"day":"2022-09-17","start":"20:00:00","end":null},{"day":"2022-09-18","start":"16:00:00","end":"21:00:00"}],"prices":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"visit_profile":{"list":[337],"translations":{"fr":["Highlight"],"nl":["Highlight"],"en":["Highlight"]}},"tags":["major_event"],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-07-21T01:08:04+02:00","published_at":"2022-05-30T14:02:39+02:00","backoffice_id":254633,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"festival","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.28543716208189},{"id":536340,"date_start":"2022-07-06","date_end":"2022-08-24","date_next":"2022-07-27","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":true,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours"}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"D\u00e9couverte des 4 vall\u00e9es d'Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"* La vall\u00e9e du BROECK  -  De BROEKvallei \r\n  \r\nmer. wo. 06.07 + mer. wo. 03.08\r\n\r\nD\u00e9part & arriv\u00e9e : \u00e0 l\u2019angle de l\u2019avenue de la F\u00e9condit\u00e9 et de la rue de l\u2019Enthousiasme\r\nVertrek & aankomst: op de hoek van de Vruchtbaarheidslaan en de Geestdriftstraat\r\n\r\n- La promenade d\u00e9bute o\u00f9 le ruisseau, le Broekbeek entre sur le territoire et longe la cit\u00e9-jardin du Bon Air. Vous prendrez la direction Neerpede \u00e0 travers les paysages ruraux du plateau de Scherdemael et aboutirez aux abords de l\u2019\u00e9tang r\u00e9gional de la Pede.\r\n- De wandeling begint waar de Broekbeek het grondgebied binnenstroomt en langs de tuinwijk Goede Lucht loopt. Ze voert u richting Neerpede door het landelijke landschap van het plateau van Scherdemaal en eindigt bij de gewestelijke Pedevijver. \r\n\r\n\r\n* La vall\u00e9e de la SENNE  -  De ZENNEvallei\r\n\r\n  mer. wo. 13.07 + mer. wo. 10.08\r\n\r\nD\u00e9part : arr\u00eat Bollinckx - Arriv\u00e9e : \u00ab Pont du Charroi\u00a0\u00bb - boulevard Paepsem\r\nVertrek: bushalte \u00ab Bollinckx \u00bb  Aankomst: \u00ab Pont du Charroi \u00bb - Paapsemlaan\r\n\r\n- Vous d\u00e9couvrirez les derniers vestiges de la Senne,rivi\u00e8re \u00e0 ciel ouvert \u00e0 Anderlecht. La balade vous montrera au gr\u00e9 des chemins son pass\u00e9 industriel, \r\nson \u00e9cluse, son d\u00e9versoir, et le r\u00e9am\u00e9nagement de ses berges en une promenade aux aspects tant\u00f4t urbains tant\u00f4t champ\u00eatres, \u00e0 la rencontre de nouveaux quartiers, d\u2019oiseaux aquatiques, de batraciens et de flore sauvage.\r\n- Ontdek de laatste overblijfselen van de Zenne, een rivier in open lucht in Anderlecht. Tijdens de wandeling maakt u kennis met het industri\u00eble verleden, de sluis, de overloop en de herinrichting van de oevers, waarbij u zowel stedelijke als landelijke aspecten tegenkomt en nieuwe wijken, watervogels, amfibie\u00ebn en wilde flora leert kennen.\r\n\r\n\r\n* La vall\u00e9e de la PEDE  -  De PEDEvallei\r\n  \r\nmer. wo. 20.07 + mer. wo. 17.08\r\n\r\nD\u00e9part & arriv\u00e9e : arr\u00eat \u00ab Marius Renard \u00bb\r\nVertrek & aankomst: bushalte \u00abMarius Renard\u00bb\r\n\r\n- Porte d\u2019entr\u00e9e du Pajottenland, la balade vous d\u00e9voilera au fil des eaux de la Pede, du parc des Etangs au vallon du Koeivijver, en passant par l\u2019\u00e9tang \r\nr\u00e9gional de Neerpede, un paysage de campagne, bord\u00e9 de bocages, de p\u00e2tures, de champs, de fermettes..\r\n- Deze wandeling voert u langs het water van de Pede, de toegangspoort tot het Pajottenland, van het Vijverpark tot de vallei van de Koeivijver, via de \r\ngewestelijke vijver van Neerpede, door een landelijk landschap met boomgaarden, weiden, velden en boerderijtjes.\r\n\r\n\r\n* La vall\u00e9e du VOGELZANG  -  De VOGELZANGvallei\r\n  \r\nmer. wo. 27.07 + mer. wo. 24.08\r\n\r\nD\u00e9part : station \u00ab Erasme \u00bb - Arriv\u00e9e : station \u00ab Ceria \u00bb\r\nVertrek: station \u00abErasmus\u00bb - Aankomst: station \u00ab Coovi \u00bb\r\n\r\n- V\u00e9ritable \u00e9crin de verdure dans la ville, la balade vous guidera du parc du Vogelzang, en passant le long de ses \u00e9tangs et mares, pour rejoindre les m\u00e9andres naturels de la R\u00e9serve Naturelle du Vogelzangbeek.  Vous aurez l\u2019occasion d\u2019observer divers am\u00e9nagements ainsi que la faune et la flore locales.\r\n- De wandeling leidt u vanuit het Vogelzangpark, een groene parel in de stad, langs de vijvers en poelen, tot aan de natuurlijke meanders van het natuurreservaat van de Vogelzangbeek.  U krijgt de gelegenheid om verschillende inrichtingen en de plaatselijke flora en fauna te bewonderen.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"tourisme@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 526 83 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 526 83 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/536340.html"},"nl":{"name":"Ontdek de 4 valleien van Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"toerisme@anderlecht.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 526 83 51","phone_booking":"+32 2 526 83 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/536340.html"},"en":{"name":"D\u00e9couverte des 4 vall\u00e9es d'Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/536340.html"},"de":{"name":"D\u00e9couverte des 4 vall\u00e9es d'Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/536340.html"},"it":{"name":"D\u00e9couverte des 4 vall\u00e9es d'Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/536340.html"},"sp":{"name":"D\u00e9couverte des 4 vall\u00e9es d'Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/536340.html"},"pt":{"name":"D\u00e9couverte des 4 vall\u00e9es d'Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/536340.html"},"cn":{"name":"D\u00e9couverte des 4 vall\u00e9es d'Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"ema