me":"Brussels for beginners","shortdescr":"Does your knowledge of Brussels boil down to the Manneken-Pis and Saint-Hubert Galeries? Do you wish to discover other neighbourhoods? Join our \u201cBrussels for Beginners\u201d bike ride!","longdescr":"During this tour, we will drive through the European district and the Cinquantenaire park (stopping at the Berlaymont building) and the beautiful Art Nouveau Squares quarter.\r\n\r\nNext, we continue our route to the city centre through the city\u2019s main park (ederal parliament, royal palace) and its contrasting neighbourhoods, remarkable monuments, and charming squares (Marolles district and the Palais de Justice, the Dansaert and Beguinage districts, ...). An original route, that steers clear from clich\u00e9s!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/527582.html"},"de":{"name":"Brussels for beginners","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/527582.html"},"it":{"name":"Brussels for beginners","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/527582.html"},"sp":{"name":"Brussels for beginners","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/527582.html"},"pt":{"name":"Brussels for beginners","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/527582.html"},"cn":{"name":"Brussels for beginners","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/527582.html"}},"place":{"id":228485,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Pro Velo","address_street_name":"Rue de Londres","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@provelo.org","website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de Londres, 15","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Pro V\u00e9lo est une association au guidon fermement dirig\u00e9 en faveur des cyclistes bruxellois. Elle propose des promenades guid\u00e9es sur deux roues en fran\u00e7ais, n\u00e9erlandais et anglais. Une id\u00e9e sympathique qui permet d\u2019appr\u00e9cier la petite reine ET les richesses multiples de l\u2019environnement bruxellois. Il n\u2019y a plus qu\u2019\u00e0 baisser la t\u00eate pour avoir l\u2019air d\u2019un coureur! Mais non, ce serait dommage, levez les yeux et appr\u00e9ciez le paysage...\r\nLangues: allemand - anglais - espagnol - fran\u00e7ais - n\u00e9erlandais - portugais","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Pro Velo","address_street_name":"Londenstraat","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@provelo.org","website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Londenstraat, 15","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"De vzw Pro V\u00e9lo streeft naar meer mobiliteit voor de Brusselse fietsers en organiseert gegidste fietstochten in het Nederlands, Frans en Engels. Kortom, een fijn idee voor wie graag met de haren in de wind de stad afschuimt.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":