ly"]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-07-21T01:35:10+02:00","published_at":"2022-06-15T10:59:24+02:00","backoffice_id":256029,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.32548726473767},{"id":530851,"date_start":"2022-07-02","date_end":"2022-08-28","date_next":"2022-07-21","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition"}},"others":{"list":[36,46],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Pluridisciplinaire"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Multidisciplinair"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Multidisciplinary"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Balade Reptilienne","shortdescr":"A l'occasion de ses 20 ans, le Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique proposera l'exposition collective Balade Reptilienne. De nombreux artistes ont r\u00e9interpr\u00e9t\u00e9 des crocodiles en r\u00e9sine mis \u00e0 leur disposition.","longdescr":"A l'occasion de ses 20 ans, le Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique proposera l'exposition collective Balade Reptilienne. De nombreux artistes ont r\u00e9interpr\u00e9t\u00e9 des crocodiles en r\u00e9sine mis \u00e0 leur disposition. Du Crokot'Frit au Croco-timbr\u00e9 venez d\u00e9couvrir ces dr\u00f4les de cr\u00e9atures et visiter la collection atypique et unique \u00e0 Bruxelles du Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique. Un voyage au sein d'un univers fantasque et f\u00e9\u00e9riques au pays des reptiles.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/530851.html"},"nl":{"name":"Reptielen balade","shortdescr":"Ter gelegenheid van het 20 jaar bestaan van het Fantastische Kunst Museum stelt het museum een uniek Reptielen balade voor.","longdescr":"Ter gelegenheid van het 20 jaar bestaan van het Fantastische Kunst Museum stelt het museum een uniek Reptielen balade voor. Meerdere Kunstenaars hebben krokodillen uit Hars omgetoverd en dit gaande van Krokofriet tot geillumineerde Reptielen. Deze Reptielen werden ter\u00a0 beschikking gesteld aan kunstenaars. Kom met de kinderen de ouders en vrienden deze zeer Unieke alsook atypische tentoonstelling bewonderen. Ga op reis in de fee\u00ebrieke komische wereld van de Reptielen aangeboden door het fantastische Kunst Museum.\u00a0","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/530851.html"},"en":{"name":"Reptilian Walk","shortdescr":"On the occasion of its 20th anniversary, the Museum of Fantastic Art will present the collective exhibition Reptilian Walk. Many artists have reinterpreted resin crocodiles made available to them.","longdescr":"On the occasion of its 20th anniversary, the Museum of Fantastic Art will present the collective exhibition Reptilian Walk. Many artists have reinterpreted resin crocodiles made available to them. From Crokot'Frit to Croco-stamp come and discover these funny creatures and visit the atypical and unique collection of the Museum of Fantastic Art. A journey within a whimsical universe in the land of magical reptiles.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/530851.html"},"de":{"name":"Visite collection permanente + Exposition Balade Reptilienne","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/530851.html"},"it":{"name":"Visite collection permanente + Exposition Balade Reptilienne","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/530851.html"},"sp":{"name":"Visite collection permanente + Exposition Balade Reptilienne","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/530851.html"},"pt":{"name":"Visite collection permanente + Exposition Balade Reptilienne","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/530851.html"},"cn":{"name":"Visite collection permanente + Exposition Balade Reptilienne","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/530851.html"}},"place":{"id":238111,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Bruxelles est fantastique ! Ce mus\u00e9e, l'un des plus atypique de Bruxelles, pr\u00e9sente des pi\u00e8ces de diff\u00e9rentes g\u00e9n\u00e9rations qui ont toutes un point commun avec le fantastique, l\u2019\u00e9trange ou le surr\u00e9alisme. Sa collection m\u00e9lange de nombreuses techniques et invite \u00e0 l\u2019imaginaire et au voyage. C\u2019est \u00e0 la mani\u00e8re d\u2019un cabinet de curiosit\u00e9s que le mus\u00e9e propose aux visiteurs une balade fantasque et unique. Pass\u00e9s \u00e0 la moulinette du troisi\u00e8me mill\u00e9naire, Bosch, Breughel, Delvaux, Magritte, Herg\u00e9 ou Rops ne renieraient sans doute pas cet endroit fantasmagorique en plein coeur de Bruxelles !","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Museum voor Fantastische Kunst","address_street_name":"Amerikastraat","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Amerikastraat, 7","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"Brussel is fantastisch! In een herenhuis in de Amerikaansestraat, op enkele stappen van het Hortamuseum, bevindt zich het Museum voor Fantastische Kunst. Het MAF kwam er op initiatief van Michel Dircken. De compleet atypische collectie ontsluit stukken van verschillende generaties die allemaal gerelateerd zijn aan de fantasiewereld, het bizarre of surrealisme, waarbij alle kunstvormen aan bod komen. Het staat buiten kijf dat kunstenaars als Bosch, Breughel, Delvaux, Magritte, Herg\u00e9 of Rops deze plek nooit hadden willen missen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Fantastic Art Museum","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Brussels is fantastic! This museum, one of the most atypical of Brussels, presents pieces of different generations which all link to the fantastic, the strange or surrealism. Its collection mixes many techniques and invites on a journey through the imaginary. Conceived as a cabinet of curiosities, the museum is sure to offer visitors a fantastic and unique walkthrough. As would Bosch, Breughel, Delvaux, Magritte, Herg\u00e9 or Rops, you will not be able to ignore this spooky place in the heart of Brussels!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Die st\u00e4ndige Sammlung des Museums f\u00fcr Fantastische Kunst umfasst Werke und Exponate aus unterschiedlichen Epochen, deren gemeinsamer Nenner das Fantastische, das Seltsame oder das Surrealistische ist. Diese absolut atypische Sammlung mischt s\u00e4mtliche Techniken: plastische Kunst, Malerei, Bildhauerei...","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"MAF - Mus\u00e9e d'Art Fantastique","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual