tacles, conf\u00e9rences et expositions; un sarangbang, espace o\u00f9 les visiteurs peuvent pratiquer la c\u00e9r\u00e9monie cor\u00e9enne du th\u00e9; une biblioth\u00e8que; une cuisine pour les cours hebdomadaires de cuisine cor\u00e9enne et le King Sejong Institute pour les cours de langue.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Koreaans Cultureel Centrum Brussel","address_street_name":"Regentschapsstraat","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kccbrussels.be","website":"http:\/\/brussels.korean-culture.org\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 29 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 29 80","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Regentschapsstraat, 4","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Het Koreaans Cultureel Centrum van de Koreaanse Ambassade van Korea in de Europese unie en Belgi\u00eb is gevestigd in het hart van Brussel, en wil de samenwerking en uitwisseling promoten tussen Belgi\u00eb, de Europese Unie en Korea door het organiseren van verschillende culturele activiteiten. Het centrum beschikt daarvoor over een aangepaste infrastructuur zoals een evenementenhal gebruikt voor de projectie van Koreaanse films, optredens, tentoonstellingen en lezingen; een Sarangbang waar bezoekers de traditionele Koreaanse theeceremonie kunnen meemaken; een bibliotheek; een keuken waar regelmatig Koreaanse kooklessen worden gehouden en het King Sejong Institute waar de taallessen worden georganiseerd.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Korean Cultural Center Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kccbrussels.be","website":"http:\/\/brussels.korean-culture.org\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 29 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 29 80","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 4","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Korean Cultural Center in Brussels is situated in the heart of Brussels, and strives to promote cultural exchanges between Korea & Belgium and Korea & the EU by diverse cultural activities.\r\nThe center disposes of an adapted infrastructure with an event hall used for screening original Korean cinema, shows, performances, exhibitions and conferences; a sarangbang where visitors can experience Korea's traditional tea ceremony; a library, a kitchen for the Korean cooking classes and the King Sejong Institute, where Korean language classes are held.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel Cor\u00e9en de Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kccbrussels.be","website":"http:\/\/brussels.korean-culture.org\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 29 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 29 80","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 4","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Centre Culturel Cor\u00e9en de Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kccbrussels.be","website":"http:\/\/brussels.korean-culture.org\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 274 29 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 274 29 80","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 4","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Centre Culturel Cor\u00e9en de Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kccbrussels.be","website":"http:\/\/brussels.korean-cul