rofessionele kunstenaars die actief zijn in het offici\u00eble culturele milieu, om de grenzen van de in- en outsiderkunst af te tasten. art )&( marges museum is geen ghettomuseum maar een plaats van uitwisseling, een ruimte waarin de individualiteit hoogtij viert en waarin alles in het werk gesteld wordt om ervoor te zorgen dat alle doelgroepen zich thuis voelen.\r\n\r\nOpen op vrijdag, zaterdag en zondag tussen 11.00 en 17.30 uur, alleen op afspraak.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Art & marges museum","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Museum of outsider art. Since its founding in 1984 and the first exhibition of 1986, Art & Marge \u2013 now the \u2018art )&( marges [margins] museum\u2019 \u2013 promotes artists outside the mainstream. These self-taught artists, often called \u201coutsider artists\u201d, work either individually or in creative workshops in institutions for people who are mentally unwell or who are mentally challenged. In addition to the permanent collection,  temporary exhibitions will establish a dynamic dialogue with paintings by professional artists from the mainstream who are active in their cultural surroundings \u2013 the boundary between \u2018insider\u2019 and \u2018outsider\u2019 art?   The \u2018Art & Marges\u2019 museum is not a ghetto museum but a venue for exchange, where individuality is of prime importance and where all efforts are made to make all target groups feel at home.\r\n\r\nOpen Fridays, Saturdays and Sundays between 11.00 am and 5.30 pm by appointment only.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art et marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Art brut - Outsider Art - Zeitgen\u00f6ssische Kunst\r\n\r\nDas Museum Art et Marges zeigt eine Sammlung, die seit den 1980er-Jahren kontinuierlich w\u00e4chst. Dabei handelt es sich um Kunst abseits des Mainstreams, die einen Blick auf die autodidaktischen K\u00fcnslter wirft, Kunstateliers f\u00fcr Menschen mit geistiger Behinderung oder in Psychiatrien. \r\nIn den Ausstellungen mischen sich K\u00fcnstler diesseits und jenseits der Grenze des \"Au\u00dfenseitertums\" (engl. Begriff \"Art Outsider\"), die die Kunst und deren Beschr\u00e4nkungen hinterfragt.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art et marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo Art)&(Marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Desde su creaci\u00f3n, el Centro de Investigaci\u00f3n y Difusi\u00f3n del arte outsider Art en Marge (que se convirti\u00f3 posteriormente en el museo Art)&Marges) aboga por los artistas que no forman parte del circuito cultural oficial. Los conocidos actualmente como \u00aboutsiders\u00bb (ver glosario) son creadores autodidactas que trabajan solos o en talleres creativos para personas psicol\u00f3gicamente vulnerables o con alguna discapacidad mental. Algunos son internos de residencias para discapacitados mentales, hospitales psiqui\u00e1tricos, y otros son trabajadores o extrabajadores de una amplia gama de profesiones: fot\u00f3grafos, anticuarios, zapateros, m\u00fasicos...","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":149,"location":{"lat":50.83472811,"lon":4.3463823},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-07-21T01:35:32+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:19+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/afe00f7c17aa81daf262