oek terwijl u rustig jogt?\r\nVergezel ons op deze route van ongeveer 8,5 km! Ik ben er zeker van dat u iets zult bijleren over Brussel of over Europa!\r\nOm deel te nemen, moet u geen getrainde sportieveling zijn.  Ook geschikt voor \u00ab start to runners \u00bb.\r\nWaar mogelijk kan de route volgens uw wensen aangepast worden.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/514634.html"},"en":{"name":"City Run Europe","shortdescr":"Discover the European quarter while jogging at your ease!","longdescr":"Do you want to (re)discover the European quarter of Brussels and the Art Nouveau squares, while jogging at a leisurely pace ?\r\nJoin us for this tour of around 8,5 km ! I am convinced you will learn something new about Brussels or Europe !\r\nYou do not have to be a great athlete to participate : this rus is accesible for \u00ab start to runners \u00bb as well.\r\nThe route may be adapted to your wishes.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/514634.html"},"de":{"name":"City Run Europe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/514634.html"},"it":{"name":"City Run Europe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/514634.html"},"sp":{"name":"City Run Europe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/514634.html"},"pt":{"name":"City Run Europe","shortdescr