u00e9lo et en bateau","shortdescr":"Parcourez \u00e0 v\u00e9lo et en bateau la vall\u00e9e de la Senne entre Bruxelles et Vilvorde.","longdescr":"Nous partons du centre de Bruxelles en passant par Schaerbeek, Evere et Haren jusqu'\u00e0 Vilvorde. Une introduction \u00e0 la Senne, \u00e0 ses vestiges dans la ville et aux diff\u00e9rents quartiers de cette partie nord de la ville. Une balade \u00e0 v\u00e9lo aux contrastes surprenants le long du canal, des voies ferr\u00e9es et des pr\u00e9cieuses zones vertes et bleues. En arrivant \u00e0 Vilvoorde, nous prenons le bateau pour retourner au B\u00e9co-kaai. Le moyen id\u00e9al de (re)d\u00e9couvrir la ville sous un angle diff\u00e9rent !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/535969.html"},"nl":{"name":"Zennevallei, met de fiets en de boot","shortdescr":"Fiets en vaar mee door de Zennevallei tussen Brussel en Vilvoorde.","longdescr":"We fietsen van het centrum van Brussel langs Schaarbeek, Evere en Haren naar Vilvoorde. Een kennismaking met de Zenne en haar restanten in de stad en met de verschillende wijken in dit noordelijke deel van de stad. Een fietstocht met verrassende contrasten langs het kanaal, spoorwegen en waardevolle groenblauwe plekken. Aangekomen in Vilvoorde nemen we de boot terug naar de B\u00e9co-kaai. De ideale manier om de stad vanuit een ander perspectief te (her)ontdekken!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/brussel-velo\/zomerprogramma","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/535969.html"},"en":{"name":"Zennevallei, met de fiets en de boot","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/535969.html"},"de":{"name":"Zennevallei, met de fiets en de boot","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/535969.html"},"it":{"name":"Zennevallei, met de fiets en de boot","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/535969.html"},"sp":{"name":"Zennevallei, met de fiets en de boot","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/535969.html"},"pt":{"name":"Zennevallei, met de fiets en de boot","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/535969.html"},"cn":{"name":"Zennevallei, met de fiets en de boot","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/535969.html"}},"place":{"id":277608,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo est une association de guides b\u00e9n\u00e9voles locaux ayant \u00e0 c\u0153ur Bruxelles et le v\u00e9lo. Ils partagent avec enthousiasme leur passion pour la ville et le v\u00e9lo avec des visiteurs de Bruxelles et d\u2019autres Bruxellois. A v\u00e9lo ils trouvent le rythme id\u00e9al pour vous immerger dans la ville et ils offrent une exp\u00e9rience authentique \u00e0 Bruxelles. Avant tout, ils pr\u00e9f\u00e8rent vous guider hors des chemins battus et cela dans une ambiance conviviale. Vivez Bruxelles dans toute sa splendeur \u00e0 v\u00e9lo et d\u00e9couvrez plus que vous ne le pensez.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Grootgodshuisstraat","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grootgodshuisstraat, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo is een vereniging van lokale vrijwillige gidsen met een passie voor Brussel en de fiets. Ze delen hun passie voor de stad en het fietsen enthousiast met bezoekers van Brussel en andere Brusselaars. Op hun fietsen vinden ze het juiste tempo om u onder te dompelen in de stad en u een authentieke Brusselse ervaring te bieden. Bovenal begeleiden ze jullie graag buiten de gebaande paden in een vriendelijke sfeer. Beleef Brussel in al zijn pracht per fiets en ontdek meer dan jullie denken.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo is an association of local volunteer guides with a passion for Brussels and cycling. They enthusiastically share their passion for the city and cycling with visitors to Brussels and other Brussels residents. On their bikes they find the right pace to immerse you in the city and offer an authentic Brussels experience. Above all, they prefer to guide you off the beaten track in a friendly atmosphere. Experience Brussels in all its splendour by bike and discover more than you think.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","des