e d\u00e9roulent de tr\u00e8s belles soir\u00e9es.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Caf\u00e9 des Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cafedeshalles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cafedeshalles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 33 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Caf\u00e9 Des Halles, in wat ooit een overdekte markthal was pal in het midden van \u00e9\u00e9n van de meest geanimeerde pleinen van Brussel (Sint-Goriks), is een caf\u00e9 met in de gewelfde kelders een club waar regelmatig goede feestjes gebouwd worden. Boven is het gezellig keuvelen in de lederen zetels. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Caf\u00e9 Des Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cafedeshalles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cafedeshalles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 33 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Caf\u00e9 Des Halles is located in a fully renovated ancient covered market place at the very lively Place Saint-G\u00e9ry. You can chill and chat in the black leather chairs, and party in the club in the vaulted cellars.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Caf\u00e9 des Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cafedeshalles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cafedeshalles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 33 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_